# PANTHEON — NICHE FORGE v1.0
## Recursive Environmental Construction Engine
Status: Architectural seed / implementation-ready design
Date: 2026-10-17
Dependencies: None mandatory
Integrations: Pantheon-Prime, Delta Calculus, Growth Grammar,
Semantic LiDAR, Prism Guitar, Bootloader, NTE, Reference-First
